  "prefLabel": "Tax 102.32 Municipal market data survey",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.32 “Municipal market data survey” means any document prepared by or for a municipality at the time of a reassessment analyzing any market data to arrive at base values, including but not limited to sales, leases, income and expenses.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.29); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.33); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.35); ); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
